{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42380","headline":"和锺大监泛舟同游见示 · 徐铉","name":"和锺大监泛舟同游见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潮沟横趣北山阿，一月三游未是多。\n老去交亲难暂舍，闲中滋味更无过。\n谿桥树映行人渡，村径风飘牧竖歌。\n孤櫂乱流偏有兴，满川晴日弄微波。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42380.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42380","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}